1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,375
Kyntlo comes in four plans:
Starter, Growth, Pro and Customized.

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:08,856
In the next 2 minutes, I'll help you
pick the right one for your business.

3
00:00:09,712 --> 00:00:12,013
Every plan runs on the same platform.

4
00:00:12,013 --> 00:00:14,749
What changes is which
tools are switched on,

5
00:00:14,749 --> 00:00:17,299
and how many people can use your account.

6
00:00:18,152 --> 00:00:19,845
Starter is $90 a month.

7
00:00:19,845 --> 00:00:24,850
You get the CRM, one pipeline,
funnels and pages, forms and surveys,

8
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:30,738
online booking, a live chat widget and
basic email campaigns, for up to 3 users.

9
00:00:30,738 --> 00:00:33,756
It's perfect if you're getting organised.

10
00:00:34,611 --> 00:00:36,274
Growth is $270 a month.

11
00:00:36,274 --> 00:00:41,265
It adds 2 to 3 pipelines, workflow
automation, appointment reminders,

12
00:00:41,265 --> 00:00:47,267
the full inbox with texts and WhatsApp,
and a basic AI chatbot, for up to 10 users.

13
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,956
Choose it if leads are
slipping through the cracks.

14
00:00:51,806 --> 00:00:55,162
Pro, our most popular
plan, is $490 a month.

15
00:00:55,162 --> 00:01:01,492
It unlocks unlimited AI usage, unlimited
pipelines, the advanced chatbot, Voice AI,

16
00:01:01,492 --> 00:01:06,830
missed-call text-back, the Reputation
Manager, reactivation campaigns,

17
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:13,084
memberships and courses, call tracking and
advanced analytics, for up to 25 users.

18
00:01:13,941 --> 00:01:16,831
And if you don't fit a
box, there's Customized.

19
00:01:16,831 --> 00:01:19,660
Pick exactly the features
and limits you need,

20
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:22,488
with options like multiple
brands or branches,

21
00:01:22,488 --> 00:01:25,256
custom integrations and
dedicated onboarding.

22
00:01:25,256 --> 00:01:27,654
You pay for your mix, and nothing more.

23
00:01:28,507 --> 00:01:35,102
Choose quarterly billing, and your first
3 months are half price: $45 a month for

24
00:01:35,102 --> 00:01:38,521
Starter, $135 for Growth, or $245 for Pro.

25
00:01:38,521 --> 00:01:43,162
After that, your plan renews
at the normal monthly price.

26
00:01:44,035 --> 00:01:49,205
On top of your plan, things like texts,
calls and emails are pay-as-you-go,

27
00:01:49,205 --> 00:01:51,618
at wholesale rates, with no markup.

28
00:01:51,618 --> 00:01:53,686
You only pay for what you use.

29
00:01:53,686 --> 00:01:56,030
And on Pro, AI usage is unlimited.

30
00:01:56,886 --> 00:01:58,338
So how do you choose?

31
00:01:58,338 --> 00:02:00,205
Getting organised: Starter.

32
00:02:00,205 --> 00:02:02,901
Losing leads to slow follow-up: Growth.

33
00:02:02,901 --> 00:02:04,906
Ready for AI everywhere: Pro.

34
00:02:04,906 --> 00:02:08,501
And if your operation doesn't
fit a box: Customized.

35
00:02:09,354 --> 00:02:14,132
Every standard plan starts with a
14-day free trial, with no setup fees.

36
00:02:14,132 --> 00:02:19,574
And you can upgrade or downgrade any time:
your contacts and automations move with

37
00:02:19,574 --> 00:02:19,840
you.

38
00:02:20,691 --> 00:02:21,678
Not sure yet?

39
00:02:21,678 --> 00:02:22,590
Try it free.

40
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:25,931
Start your 14-day trial
today, at kyntlo.ai.
